<title>UK: L-Bank adds 100 bln lire to 10-year bond.</title>
<headline>L-Bank adds 100 bln lire to 10-year bond.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-11-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following bond was announced by lead manager J.P. Morgan.</p>
<p> BORROWER   LANDESKREDITBANK BADEN-WUERTTEMBERG</p>
<p> AMT   *300 BLN LIRE  COUPON     7.30	MATURITY    12.DEC.06</p>
<p> TYPE	 STRAIGHT  ISS PRICE  100.76    PAY DATE    12.DEC.96</p>
<p> FULL FEES  7.0 PCT   REOFFER    =	   SPREAD	=</p>
<p> NOTES	*ORIGINALLY LAUNCHED FOR 200 BLN LIRE ON 18.NOV.96</p>
<p> MOODY	AAA	 LISTING    LUX</p>
<p> S&amp;P	  AAA	 DENOMS (M) 5-50</p>
<p> GOV LAW    ENGLISH   HOME CTRY  GERMANY</p>
<p> MGT/UND    0.25	SELL CONC  1.75</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
